      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَايَثَهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُهَايَثَهُ</span>, <i>He contended,</i> or <i>disputed, with him for superiority in abundance,</i> or
<i>multitude;</i> as, for instance, of wealth, or of
dependants or followers. (TK.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُهَايَثَةٌ</span> is syn.
with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُكَاثَرَهٌ</span>. (K.) ― 
